holepunch notes

because Endpoint can hold multiple connections at once 
we can simplify to this procedure:

given peers A and B, server S:

A->S: i want to connect to B, notify them of that
S->A: okay, B's address is xyz
S->B: A wants to connect to you. its public address is abc
(A and B will send garbage to each other's public addresses
 and simultaneously try to connect N amount of times)

the packet handler function should be the same but the initiator should begin yapping asap